From: mscharged-port contributors
Subject: [PATCH] Present complete selected XFB separately from native VI fields
Upstream-base: d664382f57002fbff143911c81b06b7e7a4b3ab4

Keep physical field history, source VI geometry/causes and completed selected XFB.
Reconstruct an independent full RGB desktop signal from the same immutable XFB,
then preserve the existing linear aspect-fit presentation. No bob interpolation
or source game/timing changes.

